From cc603e9fabbee812dc3636d5027d1ce792f7212c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (Axis wiring session)" <dawn@regentplatform.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:47:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire Transactions, Ledger, and Banking pages to real Supabase
 data

- Extract LedgerView, BankingView, TransactionsView as client components
  following the existing AccountsList/ClientsList wiring pattern
- Ledger and Banking now use the existing useJournalEntries/useBankAccounts
  hooks and existing JournalEntryForm/BankAccountForm (both already built,
  just not previously wired to any page)
- Transactions classifies each journal entry as income/expense by joined
  account category (revenue/expense), added account category to the
  getJournalEntries query and JournalEntryLine type to support this
- Update README to reflect actual positioning (done-for-you, not
  self-serve SaaS) and real module status
- Tick off completed Phase 1 items in the roadmap; flag bank account
  running balance as a known gap (not yet computed)
